<graphic graphicname="E143510J01" width="2.775699831in" height="4.7836529in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>After centering the spiral cable, perform the inspection at the position turned 2.5 turns clockwise and at the position turned 2.5 turns counterclockwise.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Set the spiral cable at the position turned 2.5 turns clockwise from the center position, and perform the inspection while turning it 5.0 turns counterclockwise.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
